S598 origin-bisection upper/lower cap certificates for Cprime

PROVED CERTIFICATE
If a small left owner pins a component endpoint to j/(nw), any cover puts
that component in the upper half-cap.  Per primary n-cell, total upper
capacity is 1/n^2.  The analogous right-endpoint law gives lower caps.

